l be protected with an approved self-closing fire doors. ','MEANS OF EGRESS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC37','FSEC_CHECKLIST',37,'Exit illumination and directional EXIT signs shall be provided. ','MEANS OF EGRESS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC38','FSEC_CHECKLIST',38,'Panic hardware is required on exit doors. In lieu of this, doors shall have no locks or latches. ','MEANS OF EGRESS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC39','FSEC_CHECKLIST',39,'Provide fire break up to the roof for ceiling areas. ','COMPARTMENTATION ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC40','FSEC_CHECKLIST',40,'Provide monitored and curtained roof of sheetmetal or non-combustible material of a minimum of 1.82m (6 ft) high spaced not more than 76 m (250 ft) & curtained area limited to a minimum of 4, 630 m2 (50,000 ft2). ','COMPARTMENTATION ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC41','FSEC_CHECKLIST',41,'Provide smoke partition at enclosed areas of 2, 083 m2 (22, 500 ft2) or less with the length of 45.7m (150 ft) or less, with self-closing fire doors. ','COMPARTMENTATION ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC42','FSEC_CHECKLIST',42,'Provide partition walls of two (2) hour fire resistance from floor to underside of floor above. ','COMPARTMENTATION ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC43','FSEC_CHECKLIST',43,'Provide interior finish as follows; Exit; Class {s}   \r\nAccess to Exit; Class {s}                            \r\nOther Spaces;  Class {s}','COMPARTMENTATION ','s,s,s',1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC44','FSEC_CHECKLIST',44,'Provide fire stopping for all concealed spaces.  ','COMPARTMENTATION ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC45','FSEC_CHECKLIST',45,'Provide standard fire wall with at least 100 cm (39.38 in) high parapets on all portion of the building on the property line. ','WALLS',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC46','FSEC_CHECKLIST',46,'Extend exterior masonry walls to form parapets or wings.','WALLS',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC47','FSEC_CHECKLIST',47,'Provide protection of all exterior walls. All exterior walls facing approved alleys which are dead-ended must have a fire resistance of {n} hours. ','WALLS','d',1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC48','FSEC_CHECKLIST',48,'Provide automatic fire dampers on wall openings. ','WALLS',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC49','FSEC_CHECKLIST',49,'Provide protection of all walls. All exterior walls facing approved alleys which are dead-ended must have a fire dampers of {0} hours.','WARNING SYSTEMS',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC50','FSEC_CHECKLIST',50,'Provide approved type heat and smoke detection system. ','WARNING SYSTEMS',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC51','FSEC_CHECKLIST',51,'Provide efficient communication system for warning occupants and calling fire department. ','WARNING SYSTEMS',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC52','FSEC_CHECKLIST',52,'Provide approved type portable fire extinguisher (dry chemical) ABC type, {n} lbs. capacity for every 200 sq.m of floor area(low hazard), 100 sq. m floor area(moderate hazard) and 75 sq. m floor area(high hazard) areas or 22.8 m (75 ft) travel distance on every floor level. ','FIRE PROTECTION ','d',1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC53','FSEC_CHECKLIST',53,'Provide {s} with {n} mm riser and coupling of fire department standards with pumps of reliable pressure & connected to an adequate water supply tank. Hose and hose cabinet shall be provided at every hose gate valve on all floors. ','FIRE PROTECTION ','s,d',1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC54','FSEC_CHECKLIST',54,'Provide Fire Service connection with a standard outlet of 64 mm, and 102 mm dry standpipe, and shall located on a street front. ','FIRE PROTECTION ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC55','FSEC_CHECKLIST',55,'Provide automatic fire extinguishing system where kitchen equipment is located (Kitchenhood). ','FIRE PROTECTION ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC56','FSEC_CHECKLIST',56,'Provide automatic chemical extinguishing system on all areas where electronic/electrical equipment are located. ','FIRE PROTECTION ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC57','FSEC_CHECKLIST',57,'Provide approved-type automatic fire extinguishing system in accordance with NFPA 13.  Approval of system plan is required prior to installation ','FIRE PROTECTION ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC58','FSEC_CHECKLIST',58,'Provide outside window opening on bedrooms with a clear opening of not less than fifty six (56) cm in least dimension and forty five-hundredths (0.45) m2 in area. The bottom of the window shall be not more than one hundred twenty two (122) cm above the floor. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC59','FSEC_CHECKLIST',59,'All liquefied petroleum gas equipment including such equipment installed at utility gas plants shall be installed in accordance with the provisions of NFPA 59. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC60','FSEC_CHECKLIST',60,'No grills or any obstruction shall be installed on window openings and/or fire exits. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC61','FSEC_CHECKLIST',61,'Provide emergency lighting facilities with automatic transfer switch to AC/DC power source. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC62','FSEC_CHECKLIST',62,'Air conditioning ducts must be provided with approved fire dampers. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC63','FSEC_CHECKLIST',63,'Roof covering must be of non-combustible materials. Combustible roof covering must have fire retardant treatment. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC64','FSEC_CHECKLIST',64,'Provide fire escape ladder.','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC65','FSEC_CHECKLIST',65,'Provide fire escape stair. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC66','FSEC_CHECKLIST',66,'All unit partition wall shall be extended up to upper floor slab and/or one (1) meter above the roofline. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC67','FSEC_CHECKLIST',67,'Provide effective means of smoke ventilation such as access panels, movable windows. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC68','FSEC_CHECKLIST',68,'Project activity shall not affect the effectivity of the existing fire protection facilities. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC69','FSEC_CHECKLIST',69,'Provide/post allowable occupant load sign/s. Such signs shall be conspicu