ably located. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC70','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',70,'Provide fire protection/suppression during construction. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC71','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',71,'Provide fire exit plan for each floor of the building showing the routes from each room to appropriate exits, displayed prominently on the door of each room. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC72','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',72,'No heating or lighting apparatus or equipment capable of igniting flammable materials shall be used in any storage or work area where rags, excelsior, hair or other highly flammable or combustible materials are stored or used. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC73','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',73,'Provide/post \"NO SMOKING\" sign/s where combustible materials are stored or handled. Such signs shall be conspicuously and suitable located. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC74','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',74,'If high hazard commodities will be stored/handled, automatic fire suppression system shall be provided.','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC75','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',75,'Provide/post \"DO NOT USE ELEVATOR IN CASE OF FIRE\" sign/s. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC76','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',76,'LPG tank/s must be installed outside the building and should be provided with safety devices that automatically stop the flow of gas should a leak develop. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC77','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',77,'Provide fire resistive walls between stair & kitchen area. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC78','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',78,'Provide outside window/s for rescue and ventilation with a minimum clear opening of 55 cm and approximately one half (0.5) m2 in area; the bottom of window opening is not more than eighty two (82) cm above the floor; it can readily be opened from the inside without the use of tools; where storm windows, screens, or antiburglar devices are used, these be provided with quick mechanism so that they may be so arranged that when opened they will not drop to the ground. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC79','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',79,'Rooms used for kindergarten, first or second grade pupils shall not be located above or below the floor of exit discharge. Rooms used for second grade pupils shall not be located more than one (1) storey above the floor of exit discharge. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC80','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',80,'Provide firefightersΓÇÖ elevator. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC81','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',81,'All correction indicated on the original approved plan from this office on {s} shall be followed. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC82','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',82,'Any changes in occupancy other than stated shall be in accordance with Rule 10.  ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC83','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',83,'Subject to inspection during construction.  ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC84','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',84,'Fire Safety Inspection Certificate must be secured before/prior to issuance of Certificate of Occupancy. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSC85','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',85,'Subject to additional requirements upon recommendation of the Fire Safety Inspector during construction phase and final inspection. ','MISCELLANEOUS ',NULL,1,'INACTIVE'),('FSEC86','FSEC_CHECKLIST','FSEC_CHECKLIST',86,'REQUIRED TO INSTALL SPRINKLER SYSTEM AND SUMIT TO THIS OFFICE THE SPECIFICATION AND BILL OF MATERIALS. 2. REQUIRED TO INSTALL/PROVIDE AUTOMATIC FIRE PROTECTION AND ALARM SYSTEM.','MISCELLANEOUS',NULL,0,'INACTIVE'),('hw01','HOT_WORKS','HOT_WORKS',1,'Available sprinklers, hose streams and extinguishers in service/operable','GENERAL',NULL,1,'ACTIVE'),('hw02','HOT_WORKS','HOT_